flowchart TD
    BOOT[Boot health collector]
    EVIDENCE[Collect journal, failed units, pacman log, boot entries, disk state]
    SNAP[Create settings and package evidence backup]
    CLASSIFY{Recovery signal?}
    REPORT[Show what happened\nwith evidence and confidence]
    ASK[Ask user before repair]
    SAFE[Safe repair plan\nrebuild initramfs / restore package set]
    VERIFY[Verify boot, services, data and configuration]
    ROLLBACK[Stop and preserve evidence\nmanual recovery media path]

    BOOT --> EVIDENCE --> SNAP --> CLASSIFY
    CLASSIFY -->|No actionable failure| REPORT
    CLASSIFY -->|Suspected update failure| REPORT --> ASK
    ASK -->|Decline| ROLLBACK
    ASK -->|Approve| SAFE --> VERIFY
    VERIFY -->|Pass| REPORT
    VERIFY -->|Fail| ROLLBACK
